[To be published in the Cazette of India, Extraordinary, Part II, Section 3, Sub-section (ii)l
GOVERNMENT OF INDIAMINIS'I'RY OF CORPORATE AITITAIRS
Notification
Ncw Delhi, dated i frseptember, 2015
S.O.----(E). - In exercise of the powers conlerred by the sub-section (6) of section129 of the Companies Act, 2013 (18 of 2013), the Central Government hereby, inpublic interest, directs that paras 5 (ii) (a) (t), s (il) (a) (2),5(ii) (e),5 (iii),5 (viii)(a),5 (viii) (b), 5 (viii) (c) and 5 (viii) (e) relating to Additional lnformation of theGeneral lnstructions for preparation of Statement of Profit and Loss in ScheduleIII of the Companics Act, 2013 shall not apply to government comPaniesproducing Defence Equipmcnt including the Space Research subiect to fulfilmentof following conditions, namely:-
Conditions:A. The Board of Directors of the Company has given consent with regardto non-disclosure of information relating to paras 5(ii)(a)(1), 5(ii)(a)(2),5(il)(e), 5(iii), s(viii)(a), 5(viii)(b), 5(viii)(c) ancl s(viii)(e), as may beapplicable;B. the Company shall disclose in the Notes forming part of the balancesheet and profit ancl loss account, the fact of grant of exemption under thisnotification;C. 1he company shall comply with the prescribed Accounting Standards;

